{"html":"\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page-inner flex flex-col justify-between\">\n    \u003cheader class=\"mast\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"brand\">\n        \u003cstrong>AlpacaNotes\u003c/strong>\n        \u003cspan class=\"kicker\">CRITIQUE &amp; EPISTEMOLOGY · 学术评议\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"masttime font-mono text-xs\">\n        \u003cspan>BREAKTHROUGHS VS LIMITATIONS · 对照象限 · PAGE 19 / 20\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"pb-2.5 border-b-2 border-ink dark:border-neutral-700\">\n      \u003ch2 class=\"ed-page-title font-serif text-[34px] font-black text-ink dark:text-white leading-tight\">\n        理论新意与局限\n      \u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 pl-3.5 border-l-4 border-accent mt-2\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">核心论断\u003c/span>\n        \u003cp class=\"ed-thesis-text font-serif text-[21px] text-ink dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold leading-snug\">\n          客观权衡跨学科几何范式的穿透力，以及现行数学形式化体系的接纳阻力。\n        \u003c/p>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-main ed-layout-split grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 my-auto h-[600px] items-stretch\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"col-span-6\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"card ed-split-card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#0f766e;\">\n          \u003cdiv>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#0f766e16; color:#0f766e;\">STRENGTHS · 突破与新意\u003c/span>\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-plus text-lg\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[26px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-4\">理论突破与方法新意\u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3.5\">\n              \n            \u003cli class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-[#2c2c2c] border-l-4\" style=\"border-left-color:#0f766e;\">\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-title font-serif text-[22px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-1\">统一物理与元数学\u003c/div>\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-desc text-[21px] leading-[1.52] text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans\">首次将广义相对论引力场、量子分支空间与自动证明统一于多计算，极具认知穿透力。\u003c/div>\n            \u003c/li>\n            \u003cli class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-[#2c2c2c] border-l-4\" style=\"border-left-color:#0f766e;\">\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-title font-serif text-[22px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-1\">实证元数学突破\u003c/div>\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-desc text-[21px] leading-[1.52] text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans\">跳出形而上思辨，对几何原本与 Metamath 全库展开大规模拓扑测量，确立量化实证工具。\u003c/div>\n            \u003c/li>\n            \u003cli class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-[#2c2c2c] border-l-4\" style=\"border-left-color:#0f766e;\">\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-title font-serif text-[22px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-1\">消解千古哲学二分\u003c/div>\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-desc text-[21px] leading-[1.52] text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans\">用受限观察者采样机制自洽统一数学的“客观发现”与“主观发明”，赋予同等实在性。\u003c/div>\n            \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"col-span-6\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"card ed-split-card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#b45309;\">\n          \u003cdiv>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#b4530916; color:#b45309;\">LIMITATIONS · 局限与挑战\u003c/span>\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-scale-balanced text-lg\" style=\"color:#b45309;\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[26px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-4\">现实局限与待解黑箱\u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3.5\">\n              \n            \u003cli class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-[#2c2c2c] border-l-4\" style=\"border-left-color:#b45309;\">\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-title font-serif text-[22px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-1\">传统逻辑对接薄弱\u003c/div>\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-desc text-[21px] leading-[1.52] text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans\">高度依赖图重写直觉，尚未与范畴论、同伦类型论（HoTT）或严格证明论建立严密代数桥梁。\u003c/div>\n            \u003c/li>\n            \u003cli class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-[#2c2c2c] border-l-4\" style=\"border-left-color:#b45309;\">\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-title font-serif text-[22px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-1\">粗粒化跃迁黑箱\u003c/div>\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-desc text-[21px] leading-[1.52] text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans\">将认知连贯类比热力学近似极具启发，但如何严格诱导出现代高等公理的量化条件尚未闭合。\u003c/div>\n            \u003c/li>\n            \u003cli class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-[#2c2c2c] border-l-4\" style=\"border-left-color:#b45309;\">\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-title font-serif text-[22px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-1\">工具链闭源门槛\u003c/div>\n              \u003cdiv class=\"ed-split-item-desc text-[21px] leading-[1.52] text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans\">分析深度绑定 Wolfram 生态，Lean4、Coq 等主流开源证明助手尚缺对应测量工具链。\u003c/div>\n            \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-bottom-bar pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-wrap flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-600 rounded-r-md max-w-5xl\">\n        \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600 text-base shrink-0\">\u003c/i>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-text text-[20px] leading-tight text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 font-sans\">\n          \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">本节要旨：\u003c/strong>\u003cspan>极具穿透力的物理唯象假说，尚待开源证明助手与代数体系的严密闭合。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"folio font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 shrink-0\">\n        \u003cspan>Stephen Wolfram · The Physicalization of Metamathematics\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n"}